    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306-a4">

                <pb facs="0322" n="316" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg316"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chief Clarence to Mr. Seat.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bluefields</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you, and for the
                    information of your Government, that by request of the people I have assumed my
                    right of office as hereditary chief of the Mosquito Indians and president of the
                    council, and that in order to preserve peace and safety to life and property and
                    to conciliate the people I have appointed the following gentlemen, <pb
                        facs="0323" n="317" xml:id="pg317"/> who were duly sworn into office, to
                    fill the vacancies that have occurred in the executive council: <list>
                        <item>Charles Lobner, American.</item>
                        <item>Henry Brown, English.</item>
                        <item>Sam Lampton, American.</item>
                        <item>Jacob Brownregg, English.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Egbert Henry Clarence</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chief and President.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>This is a true copy.</p>
                    <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. C. Braida</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
